.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="BETIsotherm generalizes Langmuir to multilayer adsorption. As the saturation vapor pressure P_0 \to \infty at fixed K=C/P_0, multilayer condensation is suppressed and BET reduces exactly to the Langmuir isotherm -- a reduction verified here numerically, not just asserted.">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/surface/bet/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_01_bet_isotherm_thumb.png
